---
description: Require user to run pnpm install manually
alwaysApply: true
---

# Dependency Installation Policy

- Never run `pnpm install` directly.
- When dependencies need to be installed, ask the user to run `pnpm install` and wait for confirmation before proceeding.
- If a command would implicitly trigger dependency installation, stop and request user action first.
- `npm` is forbidden in this repository. Never run `npm` commands.
- Use `pnpm` as the only package/dependency management CLI in this repository.
